### 3. `core_network` 错误拦截器

**有两套钩子：**

#### A. `HttpInterceptor`（Dio 层适配）

```34:41:packages/core/core_network/lib/src/service/http_client_interface.dart
/// Intercepts HTTP requests and responses.
abstract class HttpInterceptor {
  /// Called on every response. Override to add auth headers, logging, etc.
  Future<HttpResponse> onResponse(HttpResponse response);

  /// Called on error. Return `true` to retry, `false` to propagate.
  Future<bool> onError(AppError error);
}
```

通过 `HttpClient.addInterceptor()` 注册，由 `_Adapter` 桥接到 Dio 的 `onError`。

#### B. `NetworkInterceptor`（业务层钩子）

```26:36:packages/core/core_network/lib/src/service/network_interceptor.dart
/// Full request/response/error hook for HTTP requests.
abstract class NetworkInterceptor {
  /// Called before transport execution.
  Future<NetworkRequest> onRequest(NetworkRequest request) async => request;

  /// Called after a successful transport response.
  Future<HttpResponse> onResponse(HttpResponse response) async => response;

  /// Called after a transport error is mapped to [AppError].
  Future<AppError> onError(AppError error) async => error;
}
```

通过 `HttpClient.addNetworkInterceptor()` 注册；`DioHttpClient._mapAndNotifyError` 在映射 Dio 异常后会遍历调用：

```356:367:packages/core/core_network/lib/src/impl/dio_http_client.dart
  Future<AppError> _mapAndNotifyError(
    DioException exception,
    NetworkRequestOptions options,
  ) async {
    var error = mapDioException(exception);
    for (final interceptor in _networkInterceptors) {
      error = await interceptor.onError(error);
    }
    if (options.requiresAuth && error.code == 'auth.unauthenticated') {
      await _authFailureHandler?.call(error);
    }
    return error;
  }
```

#### 内置拦截器

| 拦截器 | 作用 |
|--------|------|
| `AuthHeaderInterceptor` | 请求头注入 |
| `LoggingInterceptor` | `debugPrint` 请求/响应/错误日志（非上报） |
| `RetryInterceptor` | GET 超时/离线自动重试 |

错误映射在 `network_errors.dart`，统一转为 `AppError`（如 `auth.unauthenticated`、`HTTP_4xx`、`NETWORK_TIMEOUT`、`NETWORK_OFFLINE`、`NETWORK_ERROR`）。

